.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-dns-acme-challenge-add - Add an ACME challenge TXT value


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro dns acme-challenge add [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add an ACME challenge TXT value

.PP
Adds \fBvalue\fR to the TXT record set at \fBname\fR (TTL 60); other values stay, so the apex and the wildcard of one certificate can be validated together (max 10 values per name). The service and the zone are found from the name (longest Gyro DNS zone of yours that covers it; hosting/cPanel zones are not supported). Idempotent.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/dns/acme-challenge (operationId acmeChallengeAdd, scope dns_acme)


